# In a Haze of Glory (crystalWar 38) at Rholont: available (637, an Event), accepted Prog 3 in the evening (82) and
# by day (81) against the Claws rival. Rholont beside Claws of the Griffon (available: Gifts of the Griffon
# completed, a GM; its 47 is a Progress reply and the quest-specific replies below tie or beat it; a tie takes
# container order the first time, and the rotation var is written only once two or more replies tie, so a later tie
# plays the next reply) and Songbirds in a Snowstorm (a Lua quest). A level 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria [S].
# Each state is set by GMs; after a talk Claws is set back to available (a GM) so it stays a rival; every talk is
# followed by its finish.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=-167.043,-2,55.484 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.GiftsOfTheGriffon completed
quest CrystalWar.WrathOfTheGriffon completed
mission Wotg PurpleTheNewBlack completed
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.PerilsOfTheGriffon completed
quest CrystalWar.InAHazeOfGlory available
login
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
quest CrystalWar.InAHazeOfGlory accepted
charvar Quest[7][38]Prog 3 # by day: 81, an Event, so the rival answers
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
wait vana=6
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
wait vana=12
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
trigger Rholont
finish
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: the rival again
# Songbirds in a Snowstorm (a Lua quest, group 8; available once Bonds That Never Die and the mission The Will of the
# World are completed: GMs): its Rholont 113 / 655 (Progress) and E49, its Daigraffeaux 114, against this quest's
# replies.
warp -167.043,-2,55.484 SouthernSanDoriaS
quest CrystalWar.BondsThatNeverDie completed
mission Wotg TheWillOfTheWorld current
mission Wotg TheWillOfTheWorld completed
